function normalizeVoteText(s){return String(s||'').toLocaleLowerCase().normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,'').replace(/[^\p{L}\p{N}]+/gu,' ').trim();}
function canonicalCountry(name){
  if(!name) return null;
  const raw=String(name).trim();
  const flag=detectFlag(raw);
  if(flag) return flag;
  const lower=normalizeVoteText(raw);
  for(const [flagCode,countryName] of COUNTRIES){
    if(lower===normalizeVoteText(countryName)) return countryName;
  }
  const aliases=Object.keys(COUNTRY_ALIASES).sort((a,b)=>normalizeVoteText(b).length-normalizeVoteText(a).length);
  for(const alias of aliases){
    if(lower===normalizeVoteText(alias)) return COUNTRY_ALIASES[alias];
  }
  return null;
}
function detectCountryVote(text){
  const raw=String(text||'').trim();
  if(!raw) return null;

  // 1) A flag emoji is the most reliable vote.
  const flagMatch=detectFlag(raw);
  if(flagMatch) return flagMatch;

  const lower=normalizeVoteText(raw);
  if(!lower) return null;
  const words=lower.split(/\s+/).filter(Boolean);

  // 2) Match aliases/country names. Longer names are checked first.
  const candidates=[];
  for(const [alias,country] of Object.entries(COUNTRY_ALIASES)){
    candidates.push([normalizeVoteText(alias),country]);
  }
  for(const [,name] of COUNTRIES){
    candidates.push([normalizeVoteText(name),name]);
  }
  candidates.sort((a,b)=>b[0].length-a[0].length);

  for(const [alias,country] of candidates){
    if(!alias) continue;
    // Multi-word names can appear inside a sentence.
    if(alias.includes(' ')){
      if(lower===alias || lower.includes(` ${alias} `) || lower.startsWith(alias+' ') || lower.endsWith(' '+alias)) return country;
      continue;
    }
    // Short aliases such as "us" must be whole words to avoid false matches.
    if(words.includes(alias)) return country;
  }
  return null;
}
function viewerKey(name){return String(name||'Viewer').trim().toLowerCase();}
function registerViewerCountry(viewer,country){
  const key=viewerKey(viewer);
  if(!key || key==='viewer' || !country) return {country,registered:false};
  const existing=state.viewerCountries[key];
  // Every explicit country in a new chat message is a fresh vote.
  // Do not lock a viewer to their first country: viewers can vote for
  // different countries in separate messages during the live.
  const changed=existing!==country;
  state.viewerCountries[key]=country;
  save();
  return {country,registered:changed};
}
function showVote(viewer,country){
  const name=viewer||'Viewer';
  const reg=registerViewerCountry(name,country);
  country=reg.country;
  const flag=flagForName(country);
  $('commentText').textContent=`Level 1 @${name} ${flag} ${country} +${CHAT_VOTE_POINTS}`;
  showToast(`Level 1  @${name}  ${flag} ${country}  +${CHAT_VOTE_POINTS}`);
  state.votes.unshift({name,country,flag,ts:Date.now()}); state.voteTotal=(Number(state.voteTotal)||0)+1;
  state.votes=state.votes.slice(0,30);
  addPoints(country,CHAT_VOTE_POINTS,`Chat vote by @${name}`);
  proEvent('💬', name, `${flag} ${country}`, `+${CHAT_VOTE_POINTS} POINTS`, 'VOTE');
  // addPoints() rerenders the leaderboard; render the vote ticker after the point update
  // so both the moving vote banner and ranking are refreshed together.
  renderVoteTicker();
}
function addPoints(country,pts,why){
  country=canonicalCountry(country);
  pts=Number(pts)||0;
  if(!country || !COUNTRIES.some(x=>x[1]===country)){log(`Ignored unknown country: ${country||'empty'}`);return false;}
  if(pts<=0 || pts>100000){log(`Ignored abnormal point award: +${pts.toLocaleString()}`);return false;}
  const before=Number(state.points[country])||0;
  state.points[country]=before+pts;
  log(`${flagForName(country)} ${country}: ${before.toLocaleString()} → ${state.points[country].toLocaleString()} (+${pts.toLocaleString()}) — ${why||'event'}`);
  save();
  
render();
  updateProHUD();
  renderVoteTicker();
  renderDonationTicker();
  showToast(`${flagForName(country)} ${country}  +${pts.toLocaleString()} POINTS`);
  requestAnimationFrame(()=>{
    const node=[...document.querySelectorAll('.country')].find(n=>n.dataset.country===country);
    const pod=[...document.querySelectorAll('.pod')].find(n=>n.dataset.country===country);
    [node,pod].filter(Boolean).forEach(el=>{el.classList.remove('hot');void el.offsetWidth;el.classList.add('hot')});
    if(node) node.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'nearest',inline:'nearest'});
  });
  return true;
}

// Built-in music. The browser may block audible autoplay, so we also try
// immediately on page load AND on the first real user interaction.
// Most importantly, Connect Live starts the music BEFORE any async API request,
// so the browser's user-activation permission is still valid.
const music=$('bgMusic');
function setMusicStatus(name){const e=$('musicName');if(e)e.textContent=name||'No music selected'}
setMusicStatus('Cutscene Crush - Blue Deer Studio.mp3');
try{
  music.src='assets/cutscene-crush.mp3';
  music.preload='auto';
  music.autoplay=true;
  music.loop=true;
  music.playsInline=true;
  music.volume=.35;
}catch(e){}

async function startBackgroundMusic(){
  if(!music || !music.src) return false;
  music.loop=$('musicLoop')?.checked ?? true;
  music.volume=Number($('musicVolume')?.value ?? .35);
  try{
    await music.play();
    setMusicStatus('Cutscene Crush - Blue Deer Studio.mp3');
    return true;
  }catch(e){
    log('Music waiting for browser permission: '+e.message);
    return false;
  }
}

// Try immediately (works where autoplay with sound is permitted).
startBackgroundMusic();

// On the first tap/click/key interaction, start it without requiring the user
// to open the music controls. This also fixes browsers that block autoplay.
let musicUnlocked=false;
async function unlockBackgroundMusic(){
  if(musicUnlocked && !music.paused) return;
  const ok=await startBackgroundMusic();
  if(ok) musicUnlocked=true;
}
['pointerdown','touchstart','keydown'].forEach(evt=>{
  window.addEventListener(evt,unlockBackgroundMusic,{passive:true});
});

$('musicFile').onchange=e=>{
  const file=e.target.files?.[0]; if(!file)return;
  if(musicUrl && musicUrl.startsWith('blob:'))URL.revokeObjectURL(musicUrl);
  musicUrl=URL.createObjectURL(file); music.src=musicUrl; music.loop=$('musicLoop').checked;
  setMusicStatus(file.name);
  log('Music loaded: '+file.name);
  startBackgroundMusic();
};
$('musicPlay').onclick=()=>startBackgroundMusic();
$('musicPause').onclick=()=>music.pause();
$('musicStop').onclick=()=>{music.pause();music.currentTime=0};
$('musicVolume').oninput=e=>music.volume=Number(e.target.value);
$('musicLoop').onchange=e=>music.loop=e.target.checked;
music.addEventListener('ended',()=>{if(music.loop) startBackgroundMusic()});

// Editable point values, capped to safe ranges.
